# proclitics.voc — Clitic pronouns that stand free before a later verb ('molho nenhum
# me agrada'). After a homograph they show it is that verb's subject, so the noun.
# 'se' is left out: it is also the conjunction 'if' ('molho se chover').
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

lhe
lhes
me
te
vos
